        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'tu'u'la tala ha mbele ya Hantu' Hasondo Muno",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'v'alagi'li'zye V'aizilaeli v'aku'letele maguta masoso ga muzeituni ago gagongilwe ku'nguno ya mwanga, ki'gele tala ziv'e zili'v'aka nsiku' zyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloni alazitu'u'le tala zyeni'zyo ha ibala na muki'ngo u'go gu'li' mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ki'gele ziv'ake ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'fumi'i'la mpi'ndi' mpaka ndiyu' bila ku'zima. Yeni'yi' yi'li' nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alazitu'u'le tala zyeni'zyo ha ki'nala cha zahabu nsoso ziv'e zili'v'aka nsiku' zyose ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lasole wu'fuma wu'nelezu na ku'komela migate iku'mi na iv'i'li' ku' ku'tu'mi'la kilo iv'i'li' zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu ku' ki'la mugate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Migate zyeni'zyo zilahelwe mihelo iv'i'li', ki'la muhelo migate mukaga. U'lazitu'u'le ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ha igu'lya na meza i'yo yi'v'eziv'ilwe ku' zahabu nsoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la muhelo u'latu'u'le wu'vumba wu'soso, ki'gele wu'v'e kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'nguno ya migate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, Aloni alazihele migate zyeni'zyo ha mbele yanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli ku'v'a ilagano lya nhananhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwenu'lu' lu'li' lwandi' lwamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya. V'alalyi'le migate zyeni'zyo ha hantu' hasondo, ku'nguno lu'li' lwandi' lu'sondo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Lyeni'lo li'li' ifungu lyav'o lya nhananhana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ntyomo na lu'duko lwayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga musu'mbana yu'mo u'yo nnina wav'age Muizilaeli na ise wav'age Mumisili. Musu'mbana mwenu'yu' wayaga ha nkambi' ya V'aizilaeli. Lyawu'kaga isola mu nkambi' mugati' na Muizilaeli na musu'mbana mwenu'yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' musu'mbana mwenu'yo, u'yo nnina witanagwe Shelomiti, mwaniki' mwana wamwa Dibili wa igongo lya Dani, wali'tyomokelaga lina lyamwa Mulungu na ku'li'fusa. Haho v'antu' v'amufilaga ku'mwa Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o v'amulugali'laga na ku'lindi'la i'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu alayombe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mufumye mwenu'yo mutyomoki ha ibala na nkambi', na v'ose av'o v'amwigilwe ali'tyomoka v'atu'u'le makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwakwe, hangi' iv'ilingano lyose v'amuwu'lage ku' ku'mugu'ma na mawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo amutyomokele Mulungu wakwe, yi'lamudime awu'sombe wu'kenagu'zi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la muntu' u'yo alali'tyomokele lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu yi'lamudime awu'lagwe. Iv'ilingano lyose li'lamuwu'lage ku' ku'mugu'ma na mawe, av'e mugeni mwizi'li'zi ninga muv'anda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' u'yo alamuwu'lage muntu' mwiye yi'lamudime nawe ku'wu'lagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' u'yo alawu'lage mutugo gwa muntu' mwiye yi'lamudime ali'pi'ki'ziwe, wu'panga ku' wu'panga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' u'yo alamuvulazye muntu' mwiye, nawe alali'pi'ki'ziwe vyene vivyo ki'ti' i'vyo wamuvulazyaga mwiye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iguha ku' iguha, linso ku' linso, lino ku' lino. Ki'la muntu' u'yo alamuvulazye mwiye nawe alali'pi'ki'ziwe vyene vivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu' u'yo alawu'lage mutugo gwa mwiye alafumye ndi'pi, sumbwa u'yo alawu'lage muntu' nawe yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzi'la yeni'yi' yi'li' ya v'ose, av'e mugeni mwizi'li'zi ninga muv'anda. Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wav'awi'laga V'aizilaeli gose genago. Nav'o v'amufumyaga ha ibala na nkambi' mutyomoki mwenu'yo na ku'muwu'laga ku' ku'mugu'ma na mawe. V'aizilaeli v'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
